{'symbol': 'ECL', 'date': '2021-06-25 16:30:00', 'title': "ECOLAB'S INDUSTRIAL SEGMENT ANNOUNCES PRICE INCREASE", 'text': 'ST. PAUL, MINN., JUNE 25, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- ECOLAB INC., THE GLOBAL LEADER IN WATER, HYGIENE AND INFECTION PREVENTION SOLUTIONS AND SERVICES, HAS ANNOUNCED THAT ITS INDUSTRIAL SEGMENT IS IMPLEMENTING PRICE INCREASES FOR ALL INDUSTRIAL SEGMENT DIVISIONS, EFFECTIVE IMMEDIATELY OR AS CONTRACTS PERMIT. THE NEED FOR THESE PRICE INCREASES IS DRIVEN BY THE CONTINUED AND SIGNIFICANT ESCALATION OF ENERGY AND RAW MATERIAL COSTS, TIGHTENING AVAILABILITY OF RAW MATERIALS AND RISING PACKAGING, TRANSPORTATION, PERSONNEL AND UTILITY COSTS.'}